      "prerequisiteContentKeys": ["ENG-A1-005-BE-QUESTIONS"],
      "revision": {
        "title": "Sonlar va shaxsiy ma'lumot",
        "description": "0-100 sonlar, yosh, telefon raqami va oddiy shaxsiy ma'lumot.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Maqsad\n\nBu darsda **sonlar** (0-100) va oddiy **shaxsiy ma'lumot**ni aytishni o'rganasiz: yoshingiz, telefon raqamingiz va qayerdanligingiz." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 4,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "Sonlar bir necha guruhga bo'linadi:\n\n- 1-12 alohida so'zlar: one, two, three ... ten, eleven, twelve.\n- 13-19 oxirida **-teen**: thir**teen** (13), four**teen** (14), fif**teen** (15) ...\n- 20, 30, 40 ... oxirida **-ty**: twen**ty** (20), thir**ty** (30), for**ty** (40) ...\n- Qo'shma sonlar chiziqcha bilan: twenty-**one** (21), thirty-**five** (35), forty-**two** (42).\n\nEsda tuting: **thirteen** (13) va **thirty** (30) — bular boshqa sonlar." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "Shaxsiy ma'lumot namunalari (barchasi o'ylab topilgan):\n\n- **I am 20 years old.**\n- **My phone number is 90 123 45 67.**\n- **I am from Uzbekistan.**\n- **A:** How old are you? **B:** I am twenty-one.\n- **A:** Where are you from? **B:** I am from Namangan." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PERSONAL-INFO"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Yoshingizni aytmoqchisiz: 25. Qaysi biri to'g'ri?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "I am 25 years old." }, { "id": "b", "text": "I have 25 years." }, { "id": "c", "text": "I am 25 year." } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "**Ko'p uchraydigan xato:** yoshni aytishda *have* ishlatilmaydi.\n\n- Noto'g'ri: *I have 25 years.*\n- To'g'ri: **I am 25 years old.**\n\nIngliz tilida yosh **to be** (am/is/are) bilan aytiladi va **years old** iborasi ishlatiladi." }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-NUMBERS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "\"thirty\" soni nechchi?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "13" }, { "id": "b", "text": "30" }, { "id": "c", "text": "3" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PERSONAL-INFO"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Qayerdanligingizni ayting. Qaysi biri to'g'ri?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "I am from Uzbekistan." }, { "id": "b", "text": "I from Uzbekistan." }, { "id": "c", "text": "I am from Uzbekistan country." } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
